<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">(b) </span><span id="S4.T3.st2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison of zero-shot RIS performances without and with each subcomponent</span>.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation study results using different numbers of top mask candidates and subcomponents</span>. (a) Our performances are consistently greater than when using top mask candidates selected by Global-Local <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yu et al., 2023</a>)</cite> (<math id="S4.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>: # of automatically generated clusters that differ per data sample). (b) Using the baseline feature extraction methods–Global-Local <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yu et al., 2023</a>)</cite> and HybridGL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu &amp; Li, 2025</a>)</cite>, all the subcomponents, <span id="S4.T3.11" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">C</span>ontext <span id="S4.T3.12" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">T</span>oken (CT), <span id="S4.T3.13" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">T</span>op <span id="S4.T3.14" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">C</span>andidate (TC), and <span id="S4.T3.15" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">S</span>patial <span id="S4.T3.16" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">C</span>oherence (SC) are integral for building <span id="S4.T3.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CoPatch</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
