<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>
<span id="A3.F21.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter tuning results for <span id="A3.F21.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CoPatch</span> (ViT-B/32) using 10% of the RefCOCOg val set</span>. The <span id="A3.F21.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#08306B;">deep-blue</span> and <span id="A3.F21.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#90C5E0;">sky-blue</span> lines depict <span id="A3.F21.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#08306B;">top-1</span> and <span id="A3.F21.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#90C5E0;">top-3</span> performances across exit layers. The <span id="A3.F21.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFB300;">golden</span> bars represent the number of clusters averaged across data instances for each exit layer. We set the exit layer, initial threshold, and spatial coherence proportion to be 10, 0.5, and 0.5.
</figcaption>
</figure>
